title: 'v02.0: Paginate the task list'
description: Return a bounded page of tasks instead of the whole collection
---

# v02.0: Paginate the task list

Issue: #61

The list endpoint returns every task it holds, so response size grows with the
collection and nothing bounds it.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a list request accepts a page size and an offset
- [ ] Outcome: a response carries the total count beside the page

## Findings

- The page cursor answers a different request than a downloadable export, so
  this task and v01.0 are independent rather than sequenced.

> Test strategy: unit, request a page past the end and one at the boundary.
